        "Description": "47, this new contract has just come in from the top;\r\rHugo Gro&#223;er is an assassin working for a rival organisation, We don&#39;t have enough intel to determine exactly what organisation this is, but there&#39;s no doubt they&#39;re dangerous.\r\rThe assassin is planning to poison an ICA agent currently undercover in the Biker&#39;s Hideout. Our mole&#39;s death would be a great blow to the stability of the ICA. Your mission is to eliminate the rival assassin before he can do any damage.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
